<title>UK: UK AEA Technology says may raise indicative price.</title>
<headline>UK AEA Technology says may raise indicative price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AEA Techonology, which is being privatised by the UK government, said on Monday that it was possible it would raise its indicative price range to between 250 and 280 pence per share.</p>
<p>This would raise the price range from the previously stated 240 to 270 pence level for the offer, announced on September 10. The announcement added that applications from intermediaries should arrive by 1100 GMT on Tuesday, September 24.</p>
<p>-- London Newsrooom +44 171 542 7717</p>
